{"id":"85e3ee0121bde759","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-increment.md","title":"Increment","display":"df-increment — Increment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-increment","aliases":["58-df-increment"],"display":"df-increment — Increment","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-increment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-increment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-increment — Increment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,X,T,E,s,t,\\leq_T,\\ominus_E\\in V\">\\(y,X,T,E,s,t,\\leq_T,\\ominus_E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,E)\\)</span> (process path, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\ominus_E,E\\times E,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\ominus_E,E\\times E,E)\\)</span> (time order and subtraction operation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncrementValue}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{IncrementValue}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (fully parameterized increment-value predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}increment} \\vdash \\mathrm{IncrementValue}_S(y,X,s,t,T,E,\\leq_T,\\ominus_E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,E)\\land\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ominus_E,E\\times E,E)\\land s,t\\in T\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land y=\\ominus_E(\\langle X(t),X(s)\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}increment} \\vdash \\mathrm{IncrementValue}_S(y,X,s,t,T,E,\\leq_T,\\ominus_E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,E)\\land\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ominus_E,E\\times E,E)\\land s,t\\in T\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land y=\\ominus_E(\\langle X(t),X(s)\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The time order and subtraction operation are explicit parameters; the definition no longer relies on an ambient, untyped <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> or minus sign.</li>\n<li>Increments measure process changes over time intervals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,E)$ (process path, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"y,X,T,E,s,t,\\leq_T,\\ominus_E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\ominus_E,E\\times E,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncrementValue}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}increment} \\vdash \\mathrm{IncrementValue}_S(y,X,s,t,T,E,\\leq_T,\\ominus_E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,E)\\land\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ominus_E,E\\times E,E)\\land s,t\\in T\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land y=\\ominus_E(\\langle X(t),X(s)\\rangle)","display":true},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false}],"bytes":1126,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-665","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-increment.md|58-df-increment]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}